24hb. JANUARI, 2005 No.S4

CORRIGENDUM PUBLIC HEALTH (FOOD) REGULATIONS (Rg 1 of Chapter 182} In the Public Health (Food) Regulations, the following corrections are made {a) in the Eighth Schedule -

(i) at page 134, by deleting, against the item "Potatoes, dehydrated" the amount "1000" from column 5;

(ii) at page 135, by deleting, against the item "Vegetables -dried, salted, pickled, dried salted, dried pickled", the amounts "800", "800", "450" and "1000" from columns 2, 3, 4 and 5 respectively; {b) in paragraph 2{c) of the Seventeenth Schedule, at page 161 -

(i) the proportion "1.0" in the second column, against the item "2,4-D", should be "0.1";

(ii) the proportion "0.001" in the second column, against the item "Hextachlorobenzene", should be "0.00001". PUBLIC HEALTH (FOOD) REGULATIONS, 2001 (S 27/01) In the Malay text of the Public Health (Food) Regulations, 2001 (S 27/01), published in No. 13 of Part II of the Government Gazette dated 28th. April, 2001, the ~ollowing corrections are made - {a) in the Eighth Schedule -

(i) at page 623, by deleting, against the item "Kentang dinyahhidratkan", the amount "1000" in column 5; Iii) at page 625, by deleting, against the item "Sayuran-sayuran - kering, asin, jeruk, asin kering, jeruk kering", the amounts "800", "800", "450" and "1000" from columns 2, 3, 4 and 5 respectively;

BRUNEI DARUSSALAM GOVERNMENT GAZETTE {b) in paragraph 2{c) of the Seventeenth Schedule, at page 654- li) the proportion 1.0" in the second column, against the item "2,4-D", should be "0.1"; Iii) the proportion "0.001" in the second column, against the item "Hextachlorobenzene", should be "0.00001". Dicetak oleh AWANG MOHIDIN BIN HAJI DAUD, Pengarah Percetakan, di Jabatan Percetakan Kerajaan, Bandar Seri Begawan BB3510, Negara Brunei Darussalam. Harga B$5.00
